  "description": "EF Core identity-directory plane for the Stratara stack — user↔tenant membership store (many-to-many with tenant-scoped roles and active-tenant selection), membership-backed IAuthorizationProvider (tenant roles plus global ASP.NET Identity roles), a membership-backed cross-tenant authorizer for strict tenant isolation, a code-first permission catalog with membership/role-driven resolvers, a scoped settings plane (global/tenant/user/user-in-tenant with optional at-rest encryption), and an API-key/PAT store whose keys resolve through the same membership plane.",
